{"id":"vod_bf_32509","vodId":"32509","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"四月是你的谎言","name_cn":"四月是你的谎言","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第22集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-33/87264c21ba336ef6bd804c14b4912fba.jpg"},"summary":"从很小的时候起，在母亲的引导和教导下，有马公生（花江夏树 配音）便将成为优秀的钢琴师当做了自己的毕生理想，一路走来，亦斩获了不少佳绩。不幸的是，在11岁那年，有马的母亲去世了，而有马亦再也无法听见自己所演奏的琴声，如此一来，他同自己最初的梦想渐行渐远。　　在念初三那年，一位名叫宫园薰（种田梨沙 配音）的女生出现在了有马的身边，薰演奏的乐器是小提琴。很快，有马便被薰身上所散发出来的才情和热情所吸引了。让有马没有想到的是，薰竟然指定有马成为她比赛中的伴奏，在薰的影响下，有马渐渐重燃了对于钢琴的热爱，他和薰之间的距离也因此越来越近。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,音乐,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:04:43","classic":true,"classicRank":25,"franchise":"四月是你的谎言","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OAD","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/OAD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/siyueshinidehuangyan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.